@not_reproducible
@issue
Feature: Issue #457 -- Double-quotes in error messages of JUnit XML reports

    STATUS: Problem is currently not reproducible.
    XML attributes are escaped correctly even when double-quotes are used.

Link:https://github.com/behave/behave/issues/457
User1:
If an exception is caught and the error message contains double quotes then they are not being handled correctly (i.e. encoded) in the Junit report, i.e.

